deployment = "finding_015_deployment_limit_includes_the_104_byte_envelope proves the 524184-byte module boundary, reserving 104 bytes within the unchanged 524288-byte deployment payload ceiling; the lint refuses larger artifacts even when the runtime's broader module limit admits them."

